  blind-mate PCB: 4x M2 into the CLIP PLATE's own tabs at (+/-4,+/-10); the payload only provides the sealed well + cable route
  top_plate->hopper: 6x M3 at r74.0 into Dia4 heat-set inserts in the hopper flange (both hole sets modeled)
